WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:02.970
Martin anapenda kutengeneza mashada ya maua

00:02.970 --> 00:07.670
ambayo kila moja lina urujuani 3 na zambarau 4.

00:07.670 --> 00:11.680
Kama bei ya urujuani ni V na bei ya zambarau ni T,

00:11.680 --> 00:14.370
tafuta mlinganyo unaofanana na hayo maelezo.

00:14.370 --> 00:18.140
Hebu tuone bei ya shada 1 la maua.

00:18.140 --> 00:23.770
Hivyo shada 1 la maua lina urujuani 3 na zambarau 4.

00:23.770 --> 00:26.290
Kwa hiyo urujuani 3 itagarimu mara 3

00:26.290 --> 00:28.190
ya bei ya urujuani, ambayo ni V.

00:28.190 --> 00:30.325
Hivyo hiyo ndiyo garama ya urujuani, 3V.

00:30.325 --> 00:32.330
Na kisha zambarau 4 itagarimu

00:32.330 --> 00:33.990
mara 4 ya bei ya zambarau.

00:33.990 --> 00:35.350
Hivyo itakuwa 4T.

00:35.350 --> 00:36.980
Kwa hiyo ni 3V jumlisha 4T.

00:36.980 --> 00:38.151
Kwa hiyo haiwezi kuwa hii ya kwanza.

00:38.151 --> 00:38.650
Hebu tuone.

00:38.650 --> 00:41.530
Hii hapa ni 4T jumlisha 3V.

00:41.530 --> 00:44.250
Kwa hiyo hii ni bei ya zambarau 4, 4 mara bei

00:44.250 --> 00:47.400
ya zambarau, jumlisha 3 mara bei ya urujuani.

00:47.400 --> 00:50.850
Bei ya mashada ya maua 3 ya Martin,

00:50.850 --> 00:53.730
hivyo itakuwa 3 mara hii idadi

00:53.730 --> 00:54.470
hapa.

00:54.470 --> 00:55.761
Hii ni bei ya shada 1 la maua.

00:55.761 --> 00:56.950
Tunahitaji mashada 3.

00:56.950 --> 01:01.430
Hivyo itakuwa ni 3 mara 4T jumlisha 3V.

01:01.430 --> 01:02.590
Na hebu tuone.

01:02.590 --> 01:07.020
Kama nikitaka kuzidisha, 3 mara 4T ni 12T,

01:07.020 --> 01:09.452
na jumlisha 3 mara 3V ni 9V.

01:09.452 --> 01:10.910
Kwa hiyo hii ni sawa na kuandika

01:10.910 --> 01:14.714
kama 12T jumlisha 9V.

01:14.714 --> 01:16.130
Vizuri, hiyo ni hii hapa.

01:16.130 --> 01:18.827
Hizi mbili ni milinganyo sawa.

01:18.827 --> 01:19.410
Na hebu tuone.

01:19.410 --> 01:21.118
Je kuna nyingine zilizo sawa?

01:21.118 --> 01:23.740
Hakuna, hii inasema 3 mara 3T jumlisha 4V.

01:23.740 --> 01:27.310
Hivyo nitaiweka kwenye sehemu ya machaguo yasiyotumika.

01:27.310 --> 01:30.739
Na kisha nina-- hebu tuone-- 3V jumlisha 2T.

01:30.739 --> 01:32.530
Nitaiweka katika sehemu ya machaguo yasiyotumika.

01:35.377 --> 01:35.960
Na hebu tuone.

01:35.960 --> 01:41.410
Hii ina 2V jumlisha 4T jumlisha V. kwa hiyo kama nikitaka kurahisisha hii,

01:41.410 --> 01:44.276
kama nikitaka kuichanganya mitajo V-- kama nina V mbili na

01:44.276 --> 01:46.460
nikiongeza V nyingine, itakuwa V tatu jumlisha 4T.

01:46.460 --> 01:48.975
Hivyo hii ni sawa na bei ya shada 1

01:48.975 --> 01:49.850
la maua ya Martin.

01:49.850 --> 01:51.850
Kwa hiyo hii itakuwa bei ya urujuani 2

01:51.850 --> 01:55.450
jumlisha bei ya zambarau 4 jumlisha urujuani nyingine.

01:55.450 --> 01:58.030
Hivyo ni bei ya urujuani 3 na zambarau 4.

01:58.030 --> 01:59.540
Hebu tuangalie jibu letu.

01:59.540 --> 02:01.490
Tumepata sahihi.
